<%# Dawnfold — Classifieds & Notices board + submission form.
    Nothing auto-publishes: submissions land in orders as
    pending_review for the desk; the board below shows only listings
    the desk has published, and says so honestly while it's empty. %>
<header class="masthead">
  <div class="mast-top">
    <span>VOL. I — NO. 1</span>
    <span class="mast-open">★ CLASSIFIEDS &amp; NOTICES ★</span>
    <span>ABBEVILLE, LOUISIANA</span>
  </div>
  <h1 class="mast-name" style="font-size:38px;">Classifieds</h1>
  <p class="mast-tag">The small print at the back of the paper — where the town talks.</p>
  <p class="mast-date"><a href="/dawnfold">← Read today's edition</a> · <a href="/dawnfold/sponsors">Sponsor rate card</a></p>
</header>

<div class="tbo-doors">
  <section>
    <h3>📣 The Board</h3>
    <% if (listings && listings.length) { %>
      <% for (const l of listings) { %>
      <article class="tbo-card">
        <p class="src" style="letter-spacing:2px;"><%= l.kind === 'notices' ? 'NOTICE' : 'CLASSIFIED' %></p>
        <h4><%= l.business %></h4>
        <p><%= l.text %></p>
      </article>
      <% } %>
    <% } else { %>
    <div class="tbo-card">
      <p><b>Founding listings open.</b> The board is new — the first classifieds and notices
      are being taken now, at founding prices, and the first ones in get the whole board to
      themselves. Every listing is read by the desk before it runs; nothing publishes automatically.</p>
    </div>
    <% } %>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>📝 Place a Listing</h3>
    <div class="tbo-card">
      <p>A listing runs <b>30 days</b> once the desk approves it:
      <b>Classifieds <%= money(prices.classifieds) %></b> · <b>Notices <%= money(prices.notices) %></b>
      (register prices, fee included). How it works, plainly:</p>
      <ol>
        <li>Send the listing with the form below — it lands on the desk's review queue, unpublished.</li>
        <li>Pay the listing price through the Business PayPal link (note your business name so the desk can match it).</li>
        <li>The desk reviews the text, confirms payment, and your listing runs for 30 days.</li>
      </ol>
      <form method="post" action="/dawnfold/classifieds" class="tbo-form">
        <input type="text" name="website" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true">
        <label for="clBiz">Business name</label>
        <input id="clBiz" type="text" name="business_name" required maxlength="120">
        <label for="clEmail">Contact email</label>
        <input id="clEmail" type="email" name="contact_email" required maxlength="160">
        <label for="clDept">Department</label>
        <select id="clDept" name="department">
          <option value="classifieds">Classifieds — <%= money(prices.classifieds) %> / 30 days</option>
          <option value="notices">Notices — <%= money(prices.notices) %> / 30 days</option>
        </select>
        <label for="clText">Listing text</label>
        <textarea id="clText" name="listing_text" required maxlength="600" rows="4" placeholder="What you're offering, where, and how to reach you — in your own words."></textarea>
        <p><button class="tbo-btn gold" type="submit">Send for review</button></p>
      </form>
      <p><a class="tbo-btn" href="https://www.paypal.com/ncp/payment/WA9DS6J8ERSHW" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Pay the listing price via Business PayPal</a></p>
      <p class="tbo-note">The desk may decline a listing that doesn't fit the paper (no spam, no misleading claims) — a declined listing's payment is returned. Questions? <a href="/dawnfold/sponsors">The sponsors page</a> reaches the same desk.</p>
    </div>
    <%- include('../partials/ad-slot', {slot: 'home_inline'}) %>
    <div class="tbo-card">
      <p class="tbo-note">From the same house: <a href="/onemind">Chorvix</a> · <a href="/">Tattoo Art Customs</a> · <a href="/apps">Every app</a> · <a href="/dawnfold">Today's edition</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
